UID:youth-music-trailblazer-fund-round-14-2026@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261106T131919Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DTSTART:20261120T163000Z
DTEND:20261120T170000Z
SUMMARY:Deadline 17:00 GMT: Youth Music: Trailblazer Fund (Round 14)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 20 Nov 2026 at 17:00 GMT.\n\nYouth Music's Trailblazer F
 und gives GBP 2\,000 to GBP 30\,000 to organisations in England running pr
 ojects that let children and young people aged 25 or under make\, learn an
 d earn in music. A project should do at least one of three things: trial w
 ork or test a new way of working\, sustain a grassroots programme\, or dis
 rupt the status quo. Doing all three is welcome.\n\nOrganisation: Youth Mu
 sic\nLocation: England only. Projects for children and young people aged 2
 5 or under.\nAward: GBP 2\,000 to GBP 30\,000 for organisations in England
 . No application fee.\nDuration: Round 14 projects start between April and
  June 2027. Round opened 23 October 2026\; deadline 20 November 2026 at 5p
 m\; notification 19 March 2027.\n\nMore: https://www.youthmusic.org.uk/fun
 ding/i-need-funding/trailblazer-fund?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk
 &utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.youthmusic.org.uk/funding/i-need-funding/trailblazer-fund?u
 tm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:England only. Projects for children and young people aged 25 or un
 der.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
