SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 EET: Kintai Arts: Open Call for Exhibitions 2027 (Ki
 ntai\, Lithuania\, EUR 700 artist fee)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 11 Nov 2026 at 23:59 EET.\n\nKintai Arts\, a contemporar
 y art centre and gallery in the village of Kintai near the Curonian Lagoon
  in western Lithuania\, invites proposals for three exhibitions in its 202
 7 programme. New and already-existing exhibitions in contemporary art prac
 tices are both eligible\, from solo artists\, groups or curators.\n\nOrgan
 isation: Kintai Arts\nLocation: Kintai Arts gallery\, Kintai\, Šilutė di
 strict (Curonian Lagoon)\, Lithuania. Open internationally\; exhibitions a
 lready shown in Lithuania get priority because of budget limits\, but appl
 ications from abroad are welcome.\nAward: EUR 700 artist fee per exhibitio
 n (to the artist or group)\, plus a transport contribution of up to EUR 30
 0. Accommodation provided for the exhibition period\; Kintai Arts also cov
 ers documentation and visual communication. No application fee.\nDuration:
  Three exhibitions of 1 to 1.5 months each: 1 April to 15 May 2027\, 18 Ju
 ne to 30 July 2027\, 1 October to 15 November 2027\n\nMore: https://kintai
 arts.lt/en/atviri-kvietimai/kvietimas-rengti-paroda-2027/?utm_source=artif
 icialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://kintaiarts.lt/en/atviri-kvietimai/kvietimas-rengti-paroda-2027/
 ?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Kintai Arts gallery\, Kintai\, Šilutė district (Curonian Lagoon)
 \, Lithuania. Open internationally\; exhibitions already shown in Lithuani
 a get priority because of budget limits\, but applications from abroad are
  welcome.
END:VEVENT
