SUMMARY:Deadline: Netherlands Film Production Incentive: High-End Series (O
 ctober 2026 round)
DESCRIPTION:The High-End Series strand of the Netherlands Film Production I
 ncentive extends the Film Fund's 35 percent cash rebate to high-end drama\
 , documentary and animated television series\, returning up to 35 percent 
 of qualifying Dutch production costs.\n\nOrganisation: Netherlands Film Fu
 nd (Nederlands Filmfonds)\nLocation: Netherlands. Only applicants from the
  Netherlands\, Bonaire\, Sint Eustatius and Saba may apply.\nAward: Cash r
 ebate of up to 35 percent of qualifying Dutch production costs\, capped at
  EUR 3 million per project per year per applicant production company. The 
 2026 annual budget is EUR 9.5 million across three rounds\, plus an additi
 onal EUR 0.4 million in the first round carried over from 2025. No applica
 tion fee.\nDuration: Per-project production incentive\, applied for per ro
 und\n\nMore: https://www.filmfonds.nl/en/funding/fund/netherlands-film-pro
 duction-incentive-high-end-series?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&ut
 m_medium=referral
URL:https://www.filmfonds.nl/en/funding/fund/netherlands-film-production-in
 centive-high-end-series?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=r
 eferral
LOCATION:Netherlands. Only applicants from the Netherlands\, Bonaire\, Sint
  Eustatius and Saba may apply.
END:VEVENT
