  50 m2 at the Cité internationale des arts\, round-trip travel to Paris a
 nd curatorial mentoring. No application fee.\nDuration: 3- or 6-month resi
 dencies during 2027\; 3 months for duos (artist plus researcher\, curator 
 or writer).\n\nMore: https://artexplora.plateformecandidature.com/?utm_sou
