 tforms\, covering continuous operation rather than single projects.\n\nOrg
 anisation: Flemish Government\, Department of Culture\, Youth and Media (K
 unstendecreet)\nLocation: Flanders and Brussels\, Belgium. For professiona
 l\, non-commercial arts organisations established in Flanders or Brussels 
 whose work addresses the Flemish community.\nAward: Five-year operating gr
 ant (werkingssubsidie) for 2028-2032. No fixed range is published\; the am
 ount follows the multi-year budget in your application. For scale\, 2023-2
 027 management agreements set annual grants of at least EUR 1\,181\,503 (M
 uziekcentrum De Bijloke) and EUR 2\,376\,642 (STUK). No application fee.\n
 Duration: Policy period 1 January 2028 to 31 December 2032 (five years). F
 lemish Government decision by 30 June 2027\; updated policy plan and budge
 t due 15 October 2027.\n\nMore: https://www.vlaanderen.be/cjm/nl/cultuur/k
 unsten/subsidies-kunsten/werkingssubsidies-kunsten-2028-2032?utm_source=ar
 tificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.vlaanderen.be/cjm/nl/cultuur/kunsten/subsidies-kunsten/werk
 ingssubsidies-kunsten-2028-2032?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_
 medium=referral
