 t-run art centre\, invites artists based in the Nordic and Baltic countrie
 s to apply for its 2027/2028 residency programme in central Bergen\, suppo
 rted by the Nordic-Baltic Mobility Programme for Culture.\n\nOrganisation:
  Hordaland Kunstsenter\nLocation: Bergen\, Norway. For artists with a perm
 anent address in the Nordic region (Sapmi\, Denmark\, Finland\, the Faroe 
 Islands\, Greenland\, Iceland\, Sweden\, Aland) or the Baltic countries (E
 stonia\, Latvia\, Lithuania)\; citizenship not required. Not open to artis
 ts based in Norway.\nAward: NOK 30\,000 stipend for the two-month residenc
 y\, accommodation covered\, up to EUR 500 travel support\, and a dedicated
  desk and workspace. No application fee.\nDuration: 2 months\, in one of f
 our periods: spring 2027\, fall 2027\, winter 2027 or spring 2028.\n\nMore
 : https://kunstsenter.no/triangle/5?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&
